#. TRANSLATORS: This is the name of the plugin as it appears in menus, the
#. interface window title and such
#: src/messages.h:21
msgid "Wavelet denoise"
msgstr "Talasno uklanjanje šuma"

#: src/messages.h:23
msgid ""
"This plugin allows the separate denoising of image channels in multiple "
"color spaces using wavelets."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dodatak vam omogućava da zasebno uklonite šum na kanalima slike u "
"nekoliko različitih prostora boje pomoću talasnog algoritma."

#. Tool-tips
#: src/messages.h:26
msgid ""
"Adjusts the threshold for denoising of the selected channel in a range from "
"0.0 (none) to 10.0. The threshold is the value below which everything is "
"considered noise."
msgstr ""
"Podesite prag uklanjanja šuma za izabrani kanal u vrednosti od 0 do 10. Prag "
"je ona vrednost ispod koje se sve smatra šumom."

#: src/messages.h:27
msgid ""
"Adjusts the threshold for denoising in a range from 0.0 (none) to 10.0. The "
"threshold is the value below which everything is considered noise."
msgstr ""
"Podesite prag uklanjanja šuma u vrednosti od 0 (bez uklanjanja) do 10. Prag "
"je ona vrednost ispod koje se sve smatra šumom."

#: src/messages.h:28
#, fuzzy
msgid "Select the image channel to display in the preview."
msgstr "Izaberite kanala slike iz koga želite da uklonite šum."

#: src/messages.h:29
msgid "Display all channels of the image (final image)."
msgstr "Prikazuje sve kanale slike (krajnja slika)."

#: src/messages.h:30
msgid "Display only the selected channel in grayscale mode."
msgstr "Prikazuje samo izabrani kanal u sivim tonovoma."

#: src/messages.h:31
msgid "Display only the selected channel in color mode."
msgstr "Prikzuje samo izabrani kanal u boji."

#: src/messages.h:32
msgid ""
"The YCbCr color model has one luminance channel (Y) which contains most of "
"the detail information of an image (such as brightness and contrast) and two "
"chroma channels (Cb = blueness, Cr = reddness) that hold the color "
"information. Note that this choice drastically affects the result."
msgstr ""
"YCbCr model boja ima jedan kanal za luminansu (Y), koji sadrži većinu "
"podataka o detaljima na slici (kao što je osvetljrenost i kontrast) i dva "
"kanala za boje (Cb = plavi i Cr = crveni) koji sadrže podatke i bojama. "
"Pravilan izbor kanala značajno utiče na krajnji ishod uklanjanja šuma."

#: src/messages.h:33
msgid ""
"The RGB color model separates an image into channels of red, green, and "
"blue. This is the default color model in GIMP. Note that this choice "
"drastically affects the result."
msgstr ""
"RGB model boja razdvaja sliku na crveni, zeleni i plavi kanal. Ovo je "
"podrazumevani model boja u Gimpu. Pravilan izbor kanala značajno utiče na "
"krajnji ishod uklanjanja šuma."

#: src/messages.h:34
msgid ""
"CIELAB (L*a*b*) is a color model in which chrominance is separated from "
"lightness and color distances are perceptually uniform. Note that this "
"choice drastically affects the result."
msgstr ""
"U CIELAB (L*a*b*) modelu boja hrominansa je razdvojena od osvetljenosti i "
"razdaljina između boja je vidno jednaka. Pravilan izbor kanala značajno "
"utiče na krajnji ishod uklanjanja šuma."

#: src/messages.h:35
msgid ""
"This adjusts the softness of the thresholding (soft as opposed to hard "
"thresholding). The higher the softness the more noise remains in the image. "
"Default is 0.0."
msgstr ""
"Ovo podešava mekoću praga (meki nasuprot tvrdom pragu). Veća vrednost mekoće "
"znači da će više šuma ostati na slici. Podrazumevana vrednost je 0."

#: src/messages.h:37
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Shows the previewed channels without denoising while the button is pressed."
msgstr "Vraća sva podešavanja izabranog kanala dok je ovo dugme pritisnuto."

